ctly to 20 characters.\n\nMoving to 14 syllables for confiding wishes: 我的願望是希望你有人可以傾訴 lands right at 14.\n\nFor 15 syllables about reuniting next lifetime, my first attempt 我的願望是希望我們在下一世還能重逢 runs to 17, too long. Trimming to 我的願望是希望我們下一世能重聚 brings it down to exactly 15.\n\nNow for 14 syllables about becoming wisps of black hair: 我願成為你烏黑長髮中的幾縷青絲 counts to 15, one over. Adjusting to 我願化作你烏黑長髮中的幾縷絲 to trim the count.\n\nVerifying all five lines confirms the counts land correctly - 14, 20, 14, 15, and 14 syllables respectively, matching each target.\n\nChecking end sounds: 去(qù), 賞(shǎng), 訴(sù), 聚(jù), 絲(sī) - all distinct, so no unintended rhyme scheme forms.\n\nTranslations check out:\n1. \"Many superficial beautiful times quickly passed\"\n2. \"My wish is that when you play string instruments, someone appreciates you\"\n3. \"My wish is that you have someone to confide in\"\n4. \"My wish is that we reunite in the next life\"\n5. \"I wish to become a few strands within your long black hair\"\n\nReconsidering line 5's phrasing—testing alternatives like 我願成為你烏黑秀髮裡的幾縷青絲 (15, too long) and 我願化為你烏黑秀髮中的一縷絲 (13, too short), the original 我願化作你烏黑長髮裡的幾縷絲 (14 chars) works best.\n\nVerifying line 4's character count: 我的願望是希望我們下一世能重聚 = 15 characters, correctly conveying \"reuniting in the next lifetime.\"", "signature": ""}], "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 10, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 821, "cache_read_input_tokens": 24040, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 821}, "output_tokens": 4, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "9d3416b4-51ae-4b76-b7cb-f70a54823636", "uuid": "f7411f90-6edd-4503-bbc9-09b084f05830", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T22:38:34.336Z", "request_id": "req_011CeSAKs9JCb4PNB97cRmfA"}
